# Committed proof sets keep only the evidence: captures/, contents/,
# manifest.json (plus report/identity provenance). The bench scratch the
# driver also writes inside its --out dir is NOT evidence.
bench/
logs/
seed/
supervisors.json
# Failed-attempt rotations, scratch probes, and runner logs are workspace
# noise; only the committed set-1/set-2 pair is evidence.
*.stale-*
probe*/
run-*.log*
PAIR-STATUS*
run-pair.sh
probe*/
.ui2-proof-owned
